{"id":"2bd16e25117a1eaa","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-analysis2-strong-convergence.md","title":"ZFC Analysis2 Strong Convergence","display":"df-zfc-analysis2-strong-convergence — ZFC Analysis2 Strong Convergence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-strong-convergence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-analysis2-strong-convergence"],"display":"df-zfc-analysis2-strong-convergence — ZFC Analysis2 Strong Convergence","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-strong-convergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-analysis2-strong-convergence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-analysis2-strong-convergence — ZFC Analysis2 Strong Convergence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d8eb5064b65f8a92\" href=\"?note=d8eb5064b65f8a92\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md\">../batch08/58-df-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\">\\(\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(x_\\bullet,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(x_\\bullet,X)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d8eb5064b65f8a92\" href=\"?note=d8eb5064b65f8a92\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md\">../batch08/58-df-sequence.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2StrongConvergence}_S(x_\\bullet,x,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2StrongConvergence}_S(x_\\bullet,x,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\)</span>（本文件定义的七元范数收敛谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}strong\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2StrongConvergence}_S(x_\\bullet,x,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\land\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(x_\\bullet,X)\\land x\\in X\n\\land\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(N\\leq n\\to\n\\left\\|+_X\\!\\left(\\left\\langle x_\\bullet(n),\\odot_X(\\langle-1,x\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\right\\|&lt;\\epsilon\\right)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}strong\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2StrongConvergence}_S(x_\\bullet,x,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\land\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(x_\\bullet,X)\\land x\\in X\n\\land\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(N\\leq n\\to\n\\left\\|+_X\\!\\left(\\left\\langle x_\\bullet(n),\\odot_X(\\langle-1,x\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\right\\|&lt;\\epsilon\\right)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>这里的 strong convergence 是范数收敛；原依赖 58-df-strong 指向大基数 strong，与分析语义无关。</li>\n<li>载体、标量域、加法和标量作用全部进入谓词签名；差向量由指定运算展开，不再让自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 或隐含的减法结构决定真值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d8eb5064b65f8a92","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|)$（see [[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d8eb5064b65f8a92","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(x_\\bullet,X)$ 且 $x\\in X$（see [[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(x_\\bullet,X)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2StrongConvergence}_S(x_\\bullet,x,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}strong\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2StrongConvergence}_S(x_\\bullet,x,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\land\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(x_\\bullet,X)\\land x\\in X\n\\land\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(N\\leq n\\to\n\\left\\|+_X\\!\\left(\\left\\langle x_\\bullet(n),\\odot_X(\\langle-1,x\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\right\\|<\\epsilon\\right)\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1644,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1452","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-analysis2-strong-convergence.md|58-df-zfc-analysis2-strong-convergence]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","bdbbe5a00af04978","d8eb5064b65f8a92"]}